# App icon

Follow `docs/agents/app-icon.md` (skill `app-icon`).

- Sketch in `.scratch/app-icon/candidates/`. Show PNG. Do not compile.
- Do not run `stamp_from_png.swift` on a full ictool/LC icon PNG (double 824 keyline).
- Do not use Icon Composer MCP `export_preview`.
- Sparkles are holes unless the candidate says discs.
